#: ../../library/omv.vl53l1x.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`vl53l1x` --- VL53L1X ToF distance sensor driver"
msgstr ":mod:`vl53l1x` --- VL53L1X ToF 距离传感器驱动"

#: ../../library/omv.vl53l1x.rst:7
msgid ""
"This module provides a driver for the STMicroelectronics VL53L1X time-of-"
"flight ranging sensor over I2C. The VL53L1X measures absolute distance up to"
" ~4 m using a 940 nm invisible laser emitter and a SPAD receiving array."
msgstr ""
"本模块提供了通过 I2C 驱动 STMicroelectronics VL53L1X 飞行时间（ToF）测距传感器的驱动程序。VL53L1X 使用 "
"940 nm 不可见激光发射器和 SPAD 接收阵列，可测量最远约 4 m 的绝对距离。"

#: ../../library/omv.vl53l1x.rst:11
msgid "Example usage::"
msgstr "用法示例::"

#: ../../library/omv.vl53l1x.rst:25
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "类"

#: ../../library/omv.vl53l1x.rst:29
msgid "Construct a VL53L1X driver instance."
msgstr "构造一个 VL53L1X 驱动实例。"

#: ../../library/omv.vl53l1x.rst:31
msgid ""
"``bus`` is a configured :py:class:`machine.I2C` bus object used to "
"communicate with the sensor."
msgstr "``bus`` 是一个已配置的 :py:class:`machine.I2C` 总线对象，用于与传感器通信。"

#: ../../library/omv.vl53l1x.rst:33
msgid ""
"``address`` is the 7-bit I2C address of the device. Defaults to ``0x29``."
msgstr "``address`` 是设备的 7 位 I2C 地址。默认为 ``0x29``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.vl53l1x.rst:35
msgid ""
"The constructor performs a soft reset, verifies the chip model ID, writes "
"the default configuration block to the device, and applies the start-up "
"register fix-up that the ST API performs on the first ranging start. The "
"call blocks for ~200 ms while the sensor settles. Raises ``RuntimeError`` if"
" the model ID register does not return the expected value ``0xEACC``."
msgstr ""
"构造函数会执行软复位、验证芯片型号 ID、将默认配置块写入设备，并应用 ST API 在首次启动测距时执行的启动寄存器修正。该调用会阻塞约 200 "
"ms，等待传感器稳定。如果型号 ID 寄存器未返回预期值 ``0xEACC``\\ ，则抛出 ``RuntimeError``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.vl53l1x.rst:43
msgid ""
"Write a single 8-bit ``value`` to the 16-bit device register address "
"``reg``."
msgstr "向 16 位设备寄存器地址 ``reg`` 写入单个 8 位 ``value``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.vl53l1x.rst:48
msgid ""
"Write a 16-bit ``value`` (big-endian) to the 16-bit device register address "
"``reg``."
msgstr "向 16 位设备寄存器地址 ``reg`` 写入一个 16 位 ``value``\\ （大端序）。"

#: ../../library/omv.vl53l1x.rst:53
msgid ""
"Read a single 8-bit value from the 16-bit device register address ``reg`` "
"and return it as an ``int``."
msgstr "从 16 位设备寄存器地址 ``reg`` 读取单个 8 位值，并将其作为 ``int`` 返回。"

#: ../../library/omv.vl53l1x.rst:58
msgid ""
"Read a 16-bit value (big-endian) from the 16-bit device register address "
"``reg`` and return it as an ``int``."
msgstr "从 16 位设备寄存器地址 ``reg`` 读取一个 16 位值（大端序），并将其作为 ``int`` 返回。"

#: ../../library/omv.vl53l1x.rst:63
msgid ""
"Return the contents of the 16-bit model-ID register at ``0x010F``. The "
"expected value for a VL53L1X is ``0xEACC``."
msgstr "返回位于 ``0x010F`` 的 16 位型号 ID 寄存器的内容。VL53L1X 的预期值为 ``0xEACC``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.vl53l1x.rst:68
msgid ""
"Perform a soft reset of the device by toggling the soft-reset register "
"``0x0000``. Blocks for 100 ms while the device is held in reset."
msgstr "通过切换软复位寄存器 ``0x0000`` 对设备执行软复位。在设备保持复位状态期间阻塞 100 ms。"

#: ../../library/omv.vl53l1x.rst:73
msgid ""
"Trigger a register read of ``RESULT__RANGE_STATUS`` (``0x0089``) and return "
"the final crosstalk-corrected range, in millimetres, of the single-zone "
"detector ``SD0`` as an ``int``."
msgstr ""
"触发对 ``RESULT__RANGE_STATUS``\\ （\\ ``0x0089``\\ ）的寄存器读取，并将单区检测器 ``SD0`` "
"最终经串扰校正的距离（以毫米为单位）作为 ``int`` 返回。"

#: ../../library/omv.vl53l1x.rst:78
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "常量"

#: ../../library/omv.vl53l1x.rst:83
msgid ""
"Default 91-byte configuration block written to the device starting at "
"register ``0x2D`` during construction. The block sets the interrupt "
"polarity, sigma threshold, signal threshold, intermeasurement period, "
"distance thresholds, ROI center/size, and other ranging parameters "
"recommended by the ST ultra-light driver. Most bytes are not user-"
"modifiable; refer to the in-source comments for the user-tunable fields."
msgstr ""
"在构造期间从寄存器 ``0x2D`` 开始写入设备的默认 91 字节配置块。该块设置了中断极性、sigma "
"阈值、信号阈值、测量间隔周期、距离阈值、ROI 中心/大小以及 ST "
"超轻量驱动推荐的其他测距参数。大多数字节不可由用户修改；用户可调字段请参阅源码内注释。"
